WEBVTT

00:04:29.636 --> 00:04:31.129
Ju flisni rreth asaj cka ju pelqeni.

00:04:31.129 --> 00:04:32.685
Ju madje edhe mund te negocioni.

00:04:32.685 --> 00:04:35.454
"Si mendon per specat djegesi"? (Te qeshura)

00:04:35.454 --> 00:04:38.081
"Jo shume, jam pothuajse nje tip i kerpurdhave vete."

00:04:38.081 --> 00:04:40.147
"Epo, mund ta bejme nje gjysem per gjysem."

00:04:40.147 --> 00:04:42.098
Dhe nese ke ngrene pica me dike per nje

00:04:42.098 --> 00:04:45.206
kohe shume te gjate,

00:04:45.206 --> 00:04:47.268
a nuk thoni serish,

00:04:47.268 --> 00:04:49.261
"A do porosisim te zakonshmen?"

00:04:49.261 --> 00:04:50.424
(Te qeshura)

00:04:50.424 --> 00:04:54.181
"Apo te marrim dicka pak me te guximshme?"

00:04:54.181 --> 00:04:56.009
Mire, pra kur jeni duke luajtur bejzboll,

00:04:56.009 --> 00:04:58.133
le te flasim per kohen gjate aktivitetit seksual,

00:04:58.133 --> 00:04:59.507
tek luan bejzboll,

00:04:59.507 --> 00:05:02.066
ti thjesht duhet ti cekesh bazat